cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fastPISA"
abstract: >-
  Local Python reproduction of the CCP4/PDBe PISA interface-analysis schema,
  with a COCOMAPS 2.0 residue-residue contact-map mode. Parses PDB and mmCIF,
  finds biomolecular interfaces, and emits PDBe-PISA-shaped JSON.
keywords:
  - PISA
  - protein interfaces
  - structural biology
  - contact maps
  - COCOMAPS
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "zyla"
    given-names: ""
    orcid: ""
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-08-10"
preferred-citation:
  type: software
  title: "fastPISA: local PISA reproduction with a COCOMAPS 2.0 contact-map mode"
  authors:
    - family-names: "zyla"
      given-names: ""
  year: 2026
  note: >-
    Implements the interface-analysis schema of Krissinel & Henrick, J. Mol.
    Biol. 372, 774-797 (2007) and the residue-contact classification of the
    COCOMAPS 2.0 approach (Chawla et al., Bioinformatics 2025).
